flowchart TD
    Sender[External SMTP Sender]
    Restrict[Postfix SMTP Restriction Stage]
    Milter[Rspamd Milter Stage]
    Queue[(Postfix Durable Queue)]
    Handoff[After-queue Filter Handoff]
    Tx[Create SMTP Transaction]
    Normalize[MIME Normalization]
    Fanout{Parallel Shared Security Analysis}
    Malware[Malware Scanner]
    URL[URL / Domain Scanner]
    Docs[Document / Archive Scanner]
    OCR[OCR / QR / Image]
    Static[Static / YARA]
    Split[Partition Recipients by Tenant / Policy Scope]
    ML[Inline ML / Tenant Context]
    Policy[Per-Tenant Policy Evaluation]
    Reinject[Trusted Postfix Reinjection]
    Deliver[Deliver to Customer]
    Quarantine[Quarantine]
    Hold[Hold]
    Reject[SMTP Reject]
    Defer[SMTP Defer]

    Sender --> Restrict
    Restrict -->|Reject condition| Reject
    Restrict -->|Temporary failure| Defer
    Restrict -->|Continue| Milter
    Milter --> Queue --> Handoff --> Tx --> Normalize --> Fanout

    Fanout --> Malware
    Fanout --> URL
    Fanout --> Docs
    Fanout --> OCR
    Fanout --> Static

    Malware --> Split
    URL --> Split
    Docs --> Split
    OCR --> Split
    Static --> Split

    Split --> ML --> Policy
    Policy -->|Allow / Warn| Reinject --> Deliver
    Policy -->|Quarantine| Quarantine
    Policy -->|Hold / Deep Analysis| Hold

    Reinject -. internal marker prevents re-filter loop .-> Queue
